WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.270
At any rate, I can't wait any longer!

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:14.710
I've been married for three years
and I have yet to visit Paris!

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.440
What kind of nonsense is this?!

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.180
However, Your Highness,

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.650
Paris has not been particularly safe lately.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.720
I believe now is not a good time to visit.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:27.820
You always have some kind of excuse and have
been postponing it six months, a year at a time!

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.970
The people of Paris must be anxiously waiting,
and wondering when our visit will be, as well!

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.930
Well, at any rate, we must hold a meeting
and ask the royal family for their opinion.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.980
Indeed. If something should
happen to Your Highness...

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.560
That would be absolutely terrible!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:45.800
I understand.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:46.960
I have heard enough!

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:59.180
Since speaking to you seems pointless,
I'll ask His Majesty myself!

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:12.300
Magistrate, there is no need to
worry about the safety in Paris.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.030
And why is that?

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:18.100
The Royal Cavalry will be there
to protect the royal couple.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.390
Commanded by Oscar François de Jarjayes,

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:24.010
the skillful Royal Guards will be at their side.

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:29.750
Indeed, I couldn't agree more with Duke Orléans.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:30.730
Isn't that right?

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:35.650
Isn't that right, Commander Oscar?

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.060
Indeed.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:43.220
As it is my duty, I will protect
the royal couple with my life.

