00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:58.880
<i>While attending a masquerade ball in secret,
Antoinette encounters a young nobleman.</i>

00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:02.010
<i>Even as Oscar worries about Antoinette
recklessly following her heart,</i>

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:06.350
<i>the encounter sets off the chain of
events which Oscar was dreading.</i>

